  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Resilient Democracy through Anti-Corruption (REDACT) Project is designed to reduce corruption risks related to democratic resilience in Moldova. The Project will support national authorities and civil society to detect, disrupt, and reduce impunity for criminal activity which threatens democratic resilience and electoral integrity.</narrative>
